schema HouseholdProjection
generation control-1
authority native-kernel
absorbs components/BonfyreControlPlane/semantic_operator.py.archive
note The durable food and housing flows own writes. The native semantic operator accepts only their decoded, source-bound projection records and lowers a read set without materializing a second household store.

concept FoodOfferProjection
  field offer_id text identity required
  field source_file literal household/food/current-offers.jsonl
  field source_ref text required
  field canonical_document json required

concept HousingListingProjection
  field listing_id text identity required
  field source_file literal household/housing/current-listings.jsonl
  field source_ref text required
  field canonical_document json required

concept HousingObservationProjection
  field candidate_id text identity required
  field source_file literal household/housing/current-listings.jsonl
  field source_ref text required
  field canonical_document json required

decision SemanticOperatorLowering
  input bounded source-bound addressed projections
  output read-only SemanticProgram
  rule reject-ambiguous-identity
    statement food accepts offer_id only; housing accepts exactly one of listing_id or candidate_id
  rule reject-missing-source
    statement no evidence reference or canonical projection body means no addressable record
  rule never-write
    statement lowered programs have an empty write set

decision ProjectionProof
  input source-bound projection observed claim
  output not_proven verdict
  rule observation-is-not-proof
    statement an observed availability, dog, effective-cost, or price field remains not_proven

invariant deterministic-address
  statement an address derives only from declared domain identity kind and stable identity, never title or price

invariant source-bound-read-closure
  statement every lowered read has a canonical content digest and nonempty source reference

invariant distinct-units-do-not-merge
  statement shared property identity with distinct unit identity is coexistence, not a duplicate or a price conflict

forbidden_inference source-bound household projection -> current availability, dog acceptance, effective cost, purchase authority or proof
forbidden_inference operator admission -> authority for a household action
